A cleaner app, and permissions only when you need them.

  • New typeface with clearer, steadier numbers
  • Refined colours that match in light and dark
  • The dial animates only while a test runs
  • Compact test results, and latency no longer shows a speed before it's measured
  • Nothing asked on first launch — each permission is asked by the feature that uses it
  • Tablets now use one readable column
  • Fixed settings hidden behind the navigation bar
